  "translation": "This weekend, the weather was very good. My dad, mom, and I went to the park together. The park is inside the city, and it takes twenty minutes on foot to get there. First, we took photos at the park entrance. Dad can take photos; he took many beautiful pictures. Then we entered the park and saw many flowers. Those flowers were really beautiful! I smelled them. Mom asked me: 'What flower do you like most?' I answered: 'I like red flowers, and also white flowers.' We sat down on the grass and had lunch. Lunch had bread, milk, and fruit, but no meat. I ate a lot and was very happy. After going home in the afternoon, I wrote a diary. Today was so happy!"
